    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d967">

                <pb facs="1106" n="1026" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1026"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Sultan of Turkey to President
                    Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Yildiz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-03-25"><hi rendition="#italic">March 25,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Very much touched by the felicitations you have been so good as to express to me
                    on the occasion of the Bairam. I return especial thanks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Abdul Hamid.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
